(comment DressingSomething-MedicalTreatmentEvent "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$MedicalTreatmentEvent. In each #$DressingSomething-MedicalTreatmentEvent, someone applies a bandage or medication to something.")
(comment SplintingSomething-MedicalTreatmentEvent "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$MedicalTreatmentEvent. In each #$SplintingSomething-MedicalTreatmentEvent, someone supports something with a splint.")
(comment DruggingSomeone-DrugTherapy "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$DrugTherapy. In each #$DruggingSomeone-DrugTherapy, someone administers a drug to someone.")
(comment SalvingSomething-DrugTherapy "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$DrugTherapy. In each #$SalvingSomething-DrugTherapy, someone applies a salve to something, usually for the purpose of healing.")
(comment BleedingSomeone-MedicalTreatmentEvent "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$MedicalTreatmentEvent. In each #$BleedingSomeone-MedicalTreatmentEvent, someone draws blood.")
(comment CuppingSomeone-MedicalTreatmentEvent "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$MedicalTreatmentEvent. In each #$CuppingSomeone-MedicalTreatmentEvent, someone treats someone else by applying evacuated cups to the patient's skin.")
(comment ShockingSomeone-MedicalTreatmentEvent "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$MedicalTreatmentEvent. In each #$ShockingSomeone-MedicalTreatmentEvent, someone subjects someone else to electrical shocks.")
(comment MaimingSomeone "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$IncurringAnInjury. In each #$MaimingSomeone, something injures or wounds seriously and leaves permanent disfiguration or mutilation on some living thing.")
(comment SubluxatingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$IncurringAnInjury. In each #$SubluxatingSomething, someone sprains or dislocates slightly.")
(comment DisablingSomeone-IncurringAnInjury "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$IncurringAnInjury. In each #$DisablingSomeone-IncurringAnInjury, someone injures permanently.")
(comment SomeBirdFledging "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$BiologicalGrowthEvent. In each #$SomeBirdFledging, some bird grows feathers.")
(comment RegrowSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$BiologicalGrowthEvent. In each #$RegrowSomething, something grows anew or continues growth after an injury or interruption.")
(comment SomePlantLeafing "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$BiologicalGrowthEvent. In each #$SomePlantLeafing, some plant produces leaves.")
(comment SomePlantPodding "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$BiologicalGrowthEvent. In each #$SomePlantPodding, some plant produces pods.")
(comment SomeToothGrowingThroughTheGums "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$BiologicalGrowthEvent. In each #$SomeToothGrowingThroughTheGums, some tooth grows through the gums.")
(comment WorkingUpSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$IntrinsicStateChangeEvent. In each #$WorkingUpSomething, someone develops something.")
(comment BringingSomeoneToConsciousness "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$WakingUpFromSleep. In each #$BringingSomeoneToConsciousness, something brings someone back to consciousness.")
(comment ResuscitatingSomeone "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$BringingSomeoneToConsciousness. In each #$ResuscitatingSomeone, someone causes someone else to regain consciousness.")
(comment FormingAScab "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$Healing. In each #$FormingAScab, something forms a scab.")
