(comment SterilizingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$DisinfectingProcess. In each #$SterilizingSomething, someone makes something free from bacteria.")
(comment AntisepticizingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$DisinfectingProcess. In each #$AntisepticizingSomething, something disinfects something else with an antiseptic.")
(comment HurtingSomething-IndisposedCondition "A collection of situations; a subcollection of #$IndisposedCondition. In each #$HurtingSomething-IndisposedCondition, something gives trouble or pain to something.")
(comment Distilling-ExudingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$ExudingSomething. In each #$Distilling-ExudingSomething, something gives something else off (a liquid).")
(comment Reeking-ExudingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$ExudingSomething. In each #$Reeking-ExudingSomething, something is wet with sweat or blood, as of their face.")
(comment ExtravasatingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$ExudingSomething. In each #$ExtravasatingSomething, something causes molten material, such as lava, to pour forth.")
