(comment PoulticingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$DressingSomething-MedicalTreatmentEvent. In each #$PoulticingSomething, someone dresses something by covering with a therapeutic substance.")
(comment BandagingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$DressingSomething-MedicalTreatmentEvent. In each #$BandagingSomething, someone dresses something by covering or binding.")
(comment DopingSomeone "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$DruggingSomeone-DrugTherapy. In each #$DopingSomeone, someone gives a narcotic to someone.")
(comment NarcotizingSomeone "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$DruggingSomeone-DrugTherapy. In each #$NarcotizingSomeone, someone administers narcotics to someone.")
(comment SickeningAnAgent "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$HarmingAnAgent. In each #$SickeningAnAgent, something makes an agent sick or ill.")
(comment SuperinfectingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$InfectingEvent. In each #$SuperinfectingSomething, something infects (an infected cell) further or infects a cell already containing similar organisms.")
(comment InfectingWithSmut "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$InfectingEvent. In each #$InfectingWithSmut, something affects something else with smut or mildew, as of a crop such as corn.")
(comment ChlorinatingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$DisinfectingProcess. In each #$ChlorinatingSomething, someone disinfects something with chlorine.")
(comment GalvanizingSomething-MedicalTreatmentEvent "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$ShockingSomeone-MedicalTreatmentEvent. In each #$GalvanizingSomething-MedicalTreatmentEvent, someone stimulates (muscles) by administering a shock.")
(comment MutilatingSomeone "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$MaimingSomeone. In each #$MutilatingSomeone, something destroys or injures someone severely.")
(comment CripplingSomeone "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$MaimingSomeone. In each #$CripplingSomeone, someone deprives someone else of the use of a limb, especially a leg.")
(comment HockingSomething-DisablingSomeone "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$DisablingSomeone-IncurringAnInjury. In each #$HockingSomething-DisablingSomeone, someone disables some animal by cutting its hock.")
(comment CaramelizingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$ConvertingSomething. In each #$CaramelizingSomething, someone converts something to caramel.")
(comment Verbalizing-ConvertingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$ConvertingSomething. In each #$Verbalizing-ConvertingSomething, someone converts some word into a verb.")
(comment SporulatingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$ConvertingSomething. In each #$SporulatingSomething, something converts something else into spores.")
(comment NovelizingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$ConvertingSomething. In each #$NovelizingSomething, someone converts something into the form or the style of a novel.")
(comment Deaden-ConvertingSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$ConvertingSomething. In each #$Deaden-ConvertingSomething, someone converts (metallic mercury) into a grey powder consisting of minute globules, as by shaking with chalk or fatty oil.")
