(comment Holding-ExercisingAuthoritativeControlOverSomething "A collection of events; a subcollection of #$ExercisingAuthoritativeControlOverSomething. In each #$Holding-ExercisingAuthoritativeControlOverSomething, someone takes and maintains control over something, often by violent means.")
