(comment CSQLConstructMultiPolygonFromBinaryAndSRIDFn "#$CSQLConstructMultiPolygonFromBinaryAndSRIDFn is the #$CSQLFunction
corresponding to #$ConstructMultiPolygonFromBinaryAndSRIDFn")
