translating it via SKSI into an SQL function which creates a geometry
object using the operator 'PointFromText' which is defined in the
#$OpenGISSimpleFeaturesSpecificationForSQL. See also the corresponding
#$CSQLFunction, #$CSQLConstructPointFromTextAndSRIDFn.")
