#$CSQLFunction, #$CSQLConstructGeometryCompositeFromTextAndSRIDFn.")
(comment ConstructGeometryFromTextAndSRIDFn "This function is introduced solely for the purposes of
translating it via SKSI into an SQL function which creates a geometry
object using the operator 'GeomFromText' which is defined in the
#$OpenGISSimpleFeaturesSpecificationForSQL. See also the corresponding
#$CSQLFunction, #$CSQLConstructGeometryFromTextAndSRIDFn.")
(comment ConstructLineStringFromTextAndSRIDFn "This function is introduced solely for the purposes of
