(comment TalladegaRangerDistrict "the Talladega district of Talladega National Forest in Alabama.")
(comment OakmulgeeRangerDistrict "the Oakmulgee district of Talladega National Forest in Alabama.")
(comment ShoalCreekRangerDistrict "the Shoal Creek district of Talladega National Forest in Alabama.")
