(comment Management "The collection of instances of #$PurposefulActions in which some #$IntelligentAgent performs sequences of actions (what those actions are will frequently be constrained by any number of factors, such as codes of conduct (see #$CodeOfConduct) to which the actor is contractually or otherwise obligated to follow, the judgments of agents who oversee that actor's actions, etc.) designed to allocate multiple resources and coordinate multiple activities for the purpose of accomplishing a goal.")
(comment BusinessManagement "The collection of instances of #$PurposefulAction in which some instance of #$IntelligentAgent works to maintain an agent's business interests.")
(comment ProjectManagement "The collection of project managment events.")
(comment FuelsManagement-ProactiveFireSafetyActivity "The collection of instances of #$Management in which the goal is the prevention or minimization of fires in an area by reducing, treating, or safely storing away potential sources of fuel.")
(comment UnderstoryReduction "The collection of events in which trees or brush in an area are cut down or pruned, typically in order to prevent or minimize the damage caused by fires.")
(comment RemovingFlammableDebrisFromAForestedArea "The collection of events in which downed timber, brush, logs, etc., are removed from a forested area.")
(comment FuelRearrangement "The collection of events in which hazardously large deposits of flammable materials are broken up and dispersed across a region for purposes of preventing or minimizing the damage from a fire.")
(comment HeartFunctionalClassEvaluation "A specialialization of #$MedicalTesting.  Each instance is an evaluation of the functional class of a heart.")
(comment MotorScoreEvaluation "A specialialization of #$MedicalTesting.  Each instance is an evaluation of a motor score of a medical patient.")
