(comment Gondola-Boat "A specialization of #$Boat, #$Device-UserPowered and #$Watercraft-Small (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$Gondola-Boat is a small boat powered by a single oar designed to be pushed by a person.")
(comment Gondola-Lift "A specialization of #$AerialLift. Each instance of #$Gondola-Lift are aerial cable-driven lifts with moving cabins typically used to seat passengers.")
(comment AerialLift "A specialization of #$CableDrivenConveyance. Each #$CableDrivenConveyance is a conveyance that consists of a long loop of #$Cable that is mechanically cycled to move conveyors attached to the cable, where the conveyors move above the ground.")
(comment Chairlift "A specialization of #$AerialLift. Each instance of #$Chairlift is an aerial cable-driven lift with moving chairs used to seat passengers.")
(disjointWith Gondola-Lift Chairlift)
(disjointWith AerialLift TBarLift)
(comment TBarLift "A specialization of #$SkiLift.  Each instance is a cable-driven lift that moves passengers while they slide on their skis on the ground.")
(comment typicalLocationTypeOfType "A #$BinaryPredicate that relates a specialization of #$PartiallyTangible to a specialization of #$SpatialThing-Localized.  <code>(#$typicalLocationTypeOfType THING-TYPE LOC-TYPE)</code> means that any given instance of <code>THING-TYPE</code> is likely to be found at an instance of <code>LOC-TYPE</code>.  For example, (#$typicalLocationTypeOfType #$Skyscraper #$Downtown) means that any given skyscraper is likely to be found in a downtown area.")
(comment caeQueryLibraryDefaultMaxTime "<code>(#$cAEQueryLibraryDefaultMaxTime SPECIFICATION INT)</code> means that in the CAE specification <code>SPECIFICATION</code>, the inference engine should by default be allowed INT seconds for any query.")
(comment caeQueryLibraryDefaultTransformationDepth "<code>(#$caeQueryLibraryDefaultTransformationDepth SPECIFICATION INT)</code> means that in the CAE specification <code>SPECIFICATION</code>, the inference engine should by default be allowed INT transformations for any query.")
(comment caeQueryLibraryDefaultIndeterminateTermsAllowed "<code>(#$caeQueryLibraryDefaultIndeterminateTermsAllowed SPECIFICATION TRUTH)</code> means that in the CAE specification <code>SPECIFICATION</code>, the inference engine setting for :INDETERMINATE-TERMS-ALLOWED? should by default be TRUTH for any query.")
(comment caeQueryLibraryDefaultNewTermsAllowed "<code>(#$caeQueryLibraryDefaultNewTermsAllowed SPECIFICATION TRUTH)</code> means that in the CAE specification <code>SPECIFICATION</code>, the inference engine :NEW-TERMS-ALLOWED parameter should by default be set to TRUTH for any query.")
(comment ArtificialHeartValveType "The collection of types of artifical heart valves either mechanical or biological")
(comment Pericarditis "A specialization of #$AilmentCondition.  Each instance of #$Pericarditis is an inflammation of a #$Pericardium.")
(comment preoperativeStatus "<code>(#$preoperativeStatus SURG-TYPE COND-TYPE STAT-TYPE)</code> means that <code>STAT-TYPE</code> is the subcollection of <code>SURG-TYPE</code> that is warranted for the treatment of <code>COND-TYPE</code>.</code>")
(comment medicalEventHasProcedure "Relates a medical event to a procedure performed during that event.")
